{{- else if eq .Kind "regress" }}

// {{ lower $b.IfaceName }}SatRegress{{ .Method }} answers {{ .Method }}'s own
// value with {{ .Member }} walked backwards, and every other member left as
// the subject set it.
//
// One member rather than the whole value, because the session laws read the
// key off the same answer they order. A wear replacing the value files each
// read under a different key, and a law that never compares two reads of one
// key cannot fail — which is what every zero-answering defect did here.
//
// The stamp descends from whatever the subject last returned, so the second
// read of a key is strictly older than the first however the subject numbers
